hadiths[73]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1788","Aur us ke chaar judaayen (braids) thin. \n\n[Abu 'Eisa ne farmaya:] Ye hadees gharib hai. Muhammad ne kaha: Main nahi jaanta ke Mujahid ne Umm Hani se suna ho. \nJam' al-Tirmidhi, Hadees: 1781 (Arabi matn: 1781)"
"1789","Abu Sa'eed - jo Abdullah bin Busr hain - ne riwayat ki ke maine Abu Kabshah Al-Anmari ko yeh kehte suna ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke Sahaba-e-Kiraam ke Kimam (topiya) Buthan (sir par phailay hue) hote the.\"" [Abu 'Eisa ne farmaya:] Yeh Hadith Munkar hai."""""
"1790","Huzoor (ﷺ) ki hadith ke mutabiq, Hudhaifa (raz) rivayat karte hain ke \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne mere (ya apne) tang ki takhneeb ko pakda aur farmaya: 'Yeh Izar (lungi) ki jagah hai.'\"""""""
"1791","Abu Ja'far bin Muhammad bin Rukanah ne apni taraf se riwayat ki hai ke unke baap (Rukanah) ne Nabi ﷺ se kushti lagaayi aur Nabi ﷉ ne unhein haar diya. Rukanah ne farmaya: \Main ne Rasoolullah ﷉ ko farmaate suna ke: 'Beshak ham aur mushrik ke darmiyan imaamat (pagri) topi par baandhna hi farq hai.'\"" Abu Eisa ne farmaya: \""Yeh hadith Hasan Gharib hai. Iski silsila (sanad) saabit nahi hai.\"""""""
"1792","Abdullah bin Buraidah ne apni taraf se riwayat ki, aur unke baap (Buraidah) ne farmaya: \Ek aadmi jo ek lohe ki anguthhi pehne hue Paighambar (ﷺ) ke paas aaya. Aap (ﷺ) ne us se farmaya: 'Mujhe tumhare paas kya cheez nazar aa rahi hai?'\"""""""
"1793","Ibn Abi Musa ne riwayat ki ke maine Ali (رضي الله عنه) ko suna keh rahe the ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Al-Qassi se mana farmaya."
"1794","Anas (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke: \Rasool (ﷺ) ko sab se zyada pasand tha ke woh Hibrah (ایک قسم کا ریشمی یا دھاری دار کپڑا) pehnein.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه"""""
"1795","Qutaybah ne hamse riwayat ki, Hatim ibn Isma'il ne riwayat ki, Ja'far ibn Muhammad se, unke walid se, unhone farmaya: \Al-Hasan (رضي الله عنه) aur Al-Husayn (رضي الله عنه) apne baayein haath mein angoothein pehnte the.\"" Aur yeh ek hasan sahih hadith hai."""""
"1796","Hazrat Hisham bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Maine Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ko yeh kehte huwe suna: 'Ek martabe hum logon ne Marr-e-Zahran mein ek khargosh ko uksaya. Is par Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba (raziyallahu anhum) uske peeche bhaag pade.'\"""""""
"1797","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi-e-Kareem (ﷺ) se sawal gaya ke mastigure (zabbar) ka khana kaisa hai? Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n**\Main isay nahi khata.\""**"""""
"1798","# Hadith: Ibn Abi 'Ammar ki riwayat\n\nIbn Abi 'Ammar ne riwayat kiya ki maine Jabir (رضي الله عنه) se poocha: \Kya badger (nishaat ki jaanwar) shikaar ki jaanwar hai? Unhon ne kya: 'Haan.'\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Main ne kaha: \""Kya main isay kha sakta hoon?\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Haan.\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Main ne kaha: \""Kya Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne yeh farmaya tha?\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Haan.\""\n\n[Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] Yeh Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Ahle ilm ke baaz logon ne isay ikhtiyaar kiya. Unhon ne badger khane mein koi haraj nahi samjha. Aur yahi Ahmad aur Ishaq (رحمه الله) ka qaul hai. Nabi (ﷺ) se aisi Hadith bhi marwi hai jo badger ke khane ki nakarat (nafrat) ko darshaati hai"","" lekin iski silsila (isnaad) mazboot nahi hai. Ahle ilm ke baaz logon ne badger khana nafrat se kiya. Aur yahi Ibn Al-Mubarak (رحمه الله) ka qaul hai. Yahya bin Al-Qattan (رحمه الله) ne farmaya: \""Jarir bin Hazm ne yeh Hadith Abdullah bin Ubaid bin Umair (رحمه الله) se riwayat ki hai.\"""""""
"1799","Hazrat Khuzaimah bin Jaz' (رضي الله عنه) ne rivayat karte hain ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se badger (نیولا) khane ke baare mein poocha. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kya koi badger khata hai?\"" Phir maine bhediya (بھیڑیا) khane ke baare mein poocha. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Kya kisi mein jo neki ho"","" bhediya khata hai?\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Is Hadith ki sanad mazboot nahi hai. Humein yeh sirf Ismail bin Muslim se maloom hai"","" jo Abdul Karim Abi Umayyah se riwayat karte hain. Ahadith ke kuch ulama ne Ismail aur Abdul Karim Abi Umayyah par aitaraz kiya hai. Aur woh Abdul Karim bin Qais hain."""""
"1800","Jabir (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn ghway ka gwsht khanay ky ajtyazt dy۔\"""""""
"1801","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Sanad (Chain of Narration):**\n\nAhmad ibn Mani' ne hamain sunaya, Rawh ibn Ubada ne hamain sunaya, Ibn Jurayj ne hamain sunaya, Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, Jabir (radiyAllahu anhu) se, unhone kaha:\n\n**Hadith ka Matla:**\n\n> RasoolAllah ﷺ ne ghar mein tasweeron (aṣ-ṣuwar) se mana farmaya, aur unhon ne aisi cheezein banane se mana farmaya.\n\n**Mazeed Riwayatein:**\n\nUnhon ne kaha: Aur is bab mein Ali, Abu Talha, Aisha, Abu Hurayra, aur Abu Ayyub (radiyAllahu anhum ajma'in) ki riwayatein bhi hain.\n\n**Darja (Grading):**\n\nAbu Isa (Tirmizi) ne kaha: Jabir ki hadith Hasan Sahih hai.\n\n---\n\n**Tawdeehat:**\n\n- **aṣ-ṣuwar** (الصُّوْرَةِ): Haiwanon ya ruh wali makhlooqaat ki tasweeron ka zikr hai, jise Nabi ﷺ ne ghar mein rakhne se mana farmaya aur banane se bhi mana farmaya.\n- **Hasan Sahih**: Yeh ek darja hai jo yeh bataata hai ke is hadith ki sanad Imam Tirmizi (rahmatullahi alaih) ke mutabiq achi aur sahih hai."
"1802","Abu Tha'labah Al-Khushani (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh ﷺ say zrtshtywn kay brtnwn kay baray myn swal kya gya۔ aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \anhyn dhw kr pak kr lw۔\"""""""
"1803","Abu Tha'labah Al-Khushani (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh anhwn nay arz kya: \aay allh kay rswl! hm ahl ktab kay alaqay myn rhtay hyn awr an kay brtwn myn pkatay hyn۔\"""""""
"1804","Ibn 'Abbas (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh yh hdys mymwnh (rzy allh anha) say mrbwt hay kh ayk chwha kchh pkwan ky chrby myn gr kr mr gya۔ phr nby krym (ﷺ) say as baray myn swal kya gya tw aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \asay (chwhay kw) awr jw chyz as kay ard grd hw hta dw، phr asay (chrby) khao۔\"" rawy ka khna hay kh as bab myn abwhryrh (rzy allh anh) say bhy rwayt hay۔ abw aysyٰ ka khna hay: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ yh hdys zhry say bhy rwayt ky gyy hay۔"""""
"1805","Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se koi bhi apne baayein haath se na khana khaaye aur na baayein haath se pee.\"""""""
"1806","Humayd ibn Mas‘adah ne hamain hawaale farmaya, ‘Abd al-Wahhab al-Thaqafi ne hawaale farmaya, Humayd se, Anas رضي الله عنه se, unhone farmaya:\n\nRasool Allah ﷺ miqdaar-e-aam qaamat ke the, na bahut lambay the na bahut chotay. Unki jism saaqat aur khushsoorat se bharpoor thi aur unka rang gora tha. Unke baal na sakht ghungray the na bilkul seedhey. Jab woh chalte to thoda aage jhuk kar chalte the.\n\nQaail ne farmaya: Is bab mein ‘A’ishah, al-Bara’, Abu Hurayrah, Ibn ‘Abbas, Abu Sa‘id, Jabir, Wa’il ibn Hujr aur Umm Hani’ رضي الله"
"1807","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jb tm myn say kwyy khana khayay\"""""""
"1808","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi ne khaana khaya...\"""""""
"1809","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamain hadith sunayi: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hamain hadith sunayi, unho ne Hisham se riwayat ki, aur Hisham ne al-Hasan se isi sanad ke saath isi tarah ki hadith rawai ki.\n\nAbu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Ye hasan sahih hadith hai. Unho ne yeh bhi farmaya: Is bab (chapter) mein Anas (radiyallahu anhu) ki bhi ek hadith hai."
"1810","Muhammad ibn Humayd ne riwayat ki, humein Abu Dawud at-Tayalisi ne bataya, wo 'Abbad ibn Mansur se riwayat karte hain, wo 'Ikrimah se riwayat karte hain, wo Ibn 'Abbas (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Ithmid ka surma istemal karo"","" isliye ke woh nazar ko taza karta hai aur baalon ko barhata hai.\"" Yeh bhi riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek surma ka dabba tha jisse woh har raat surma lagate the"","" ek aankh mein teen baar aur doosri aankh mein teen baar. Yeh hadith mukhtalif asaanid se Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marwi hai"","" jinhon ne farmaya: \""Tum ithmid ka surma istemal karo"","" isliye ke woh nazar ko taza karta hai aur baalon ko barhata hai.\"" Abu 'Isa ne kaha: Ibn 'Abbas ki hadith ek achi hadith hai; hum is lafz ke saath ise sirf 'Abbad ibn Mansur ki hadith se jaante hain."""""
"1811","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Beshak barkat khaane ke beech mein hoti hai.\"""""""
"1812","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs in cheezon se pehli baar khaaye...\"""""""
"1813","Jabir bin Samurah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh ﷺ abw aywb (rz all anh) kay yhaq qyam frma thay۔ jb aap nay khana khaya...\"""""""
"1814","Sharik bin Hanbal ne riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Ali (R.A.) ne farmaya ke khane mein lehsun khaana haraam hai, magar jab pak jaaye (usne) istisna kiya."
"1815","Sharik bin Hanbal ne riwayat ki ke Ali (Radi Allahu Anhu) ne farmaya: \Lahsun khaana koi achhi baat nahi hai.\"""""""
"1816","Ubaidullah bin Abi Burdah riwayat karte hain ke unke baap (Abu Burdah) se ke Umm Ayyub (رضی اللہ عنہا) ne unhe bataya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne unke yahan qiyaam farmaya tha."
"1817","Abu Khaldah riwayat karte hain ke Abu Al-'Aliyah ne farmaya: \Lahsan ne'mat ke ahaat hissa hai.\"" Abu Khaldah naam hai Khalid bin Dinar."""""
"1818","Hamari taraf se ʿAlī ibn Ḥujr ne riwāyat karte hue bayān kiyā ki unhe Faḍl ibn Mūsā ne riwāyat kiyā, unhone ʿAbd al-Muʾmin ibn Khālid se, unhone ʿAbdullāh ibn Buraydah se, aur unhone Umm Salamah (raḍiya Allāhu ʿanhā) se riwāyat kiyā ki unhone farmāyā:\n\n\Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ke nazdik sab se maḥbūb libās qamīṣ (qamees) thī.\"""""""
"1819","Abdullāh ibn Muḥammad ibn al-Ḥajjāj al-Ṣawwāf al-Baṣrī ne ham se riwāyat kī, Mu‘ādh ibn Hishām al-Dastawā’ī ne ham se riwāyat kī, mere wālid ne mujh se riwāyat kī, Budayl ibn Maysarah al-‘Uqaylī se riwāyat hai, Shahr ibn Ḥawshab se riwāyat hai, Asmā’ bint Yazīd ibn al-Sakān al-Anṣāriyyah (raziyallāhu ‘anhā) se riwāyat hain ki unhone farmāyā: \Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ‘alayhi wa sallam) kī āstīn takriban rist tak pahunchtī thī.\"" Abū ‘Īsā (raḥmatullāhi ‘alayh) ne farmāyā: Ye ḥasan gharīb ḥadīth hai."""""
"1820","Ibn 'Umar (may Allah be pleased with him) rivayet karte hain ki: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne ek saath dono khajoor leney manaa farmaa diya"","" jab tak sahaabey ke ijazat na li jaaye.\"" Qayaal hai ke is mazkoor mein Sa'd"","" Abu Bakr ki azad ki hui ghulaam"","" se bhi mutallaq kuch riwaayat hai. Abu 'Eisa (rah) farmate hain: \""Yeh hadith Hasan Sahih hai.\"""""""
"1821","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Ghar mein agar khajoor na ho...\"""""""
"1822","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) rwayt krthyn kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \bht allh as ghlam say razy hwta hay jw\"""""""
"1823","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay ayk kwrhy ka hath pkr kr qsah (brtn) myn dal dya۔ phr aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \allh kay nam say khao۔\"""""""
"1824","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kafir saat aanton mein khata hai aur Momin ek aanton mein khata hai.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Unhon ne kaha: Is mazmoon par Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنهما) se bhi riwayatein hain."""""
"1825","Abu Horaira (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn: \rswl allh (ﷺ) kay mhman kw ayk kafr tha۔ tw rswl allh (ﷺ) nay hkm dya kh ayk bkry dwhy jayay takh aap (ﷺ) pyy skyn۔ phr dwsry bkry dwhy gyy takh aap (ﷺ) pyy skyn۔\"""""""
"1826","Abu Ya'fur Al'Abdi ne riwayat ki ke Abdullah bin Abi Awfa (razi Allahu anho) se makkhi (locust) ke baare mein sawaal gaya. Unhon ne kaha: \Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath chhe ghazwaat mein shareek tha."""""
"1827","Abu Ya'fur ne riwayat ki ke Ibn Abi Awfa ne farmaya: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath saat ghazwaat mein shareek hue."""""
"1828","Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nRiwayat hai Taimi se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنهما) aur Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنهما) ne farmaya: \Jab Rasoolullah (ﷺ) tiddiyon (locusts) ke khilaf dua karte to farmate: 'Aey Allah! Tiddiyon ko tabah kar de.'\"""""""
"1829","Ibn 'Umar (ra) rivayet karte hain ke Nabi (ﷺ) ne jallalah (janwaron) ke khane aur uske dohne se manaa farmaya. (Tirmizi) kehte hain ke Abdullah bin 'Abbas (ra) se bhi is mazkur hadith ke bare mein hai. Abu 'Eisa (ra) farmate hain ke yeh hadith Hasan Gharib hai. Ath-Thawri ne yeh hadith Ibn Abi Najih (ra) se riwayat ki hai."
"1830","Zahdam Al-Jarmi ne riwayat ki: \Main Abu Musa (رَضِيَ ٱللَّٰهُ عَنْهُ) ke paas gaya jab woh murghi kha rahe thein.\"""""""
"1831","Zahdam ne riwayat kiya: Abu Musa se, unhone kaha: \Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko murghi ka gosht khaate hue dekha.\"" Unhone kaha: Is hadith se aur bhi kadeemat (statements) hain. Aur yeh hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Ayyub As-Sakhtiyani ne bhi yeh hadith Al-Qasim At-Tamimi se riwayat ki hai."""""
"1832","Anas (radiyAllahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) ke do tasmalon wali sandalain thin. Abu Isa (rahmatullah alaih) ne farmaya: Ye hasan sahih hadith hai. Unhone yeh bhi farmaya ke is bab mein Ibn Abbas (radiyAllahu anhu) aur Abu Hurairah (radiyAllahu anhu) ki bhi riwayatein hain."
"1833","**Umm Salamah (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke unhain Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ke paas ek taraf se bhuna hua gosha laaya.**"
"1834","Abu Juhaidah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jhan tk myra talq hay...\"""""""
"1835","Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) mithai aur shahad ko pasand farmate the. Yeh hadith Hasan Sahih Gharib hai. Ali bin Mus-hir ne isay Hisham bin Urwah se riwayat kiya hai."
"1836","Humay Quran-e-Kareem ki taraf se aik hadith ka tarjuma ilmi aur adabi Roman Urdu mein pesh karte hain:\n\n**Riwayat:**\nHazrat Qasim ibn Dinar ne riwayat ki, Hazrat Ishaq ibn Mansur Saluli (jo Kufah ke rehne wale the) ne riwayat ki, Hazrat Huraam ibn Sufyan Bajali Kufi ne riwayat ki, Hazrat Layth ne riwayat ki, Hazrat Abdur-Rahman ibn Qasim ne apni taraf se riwayat ki, unke walid (Hazrat Qasim ibn Muhammad) ne riwayat ki, aur Hazrat Aisha Siddiqa (Razi Allah Anha) ne farmaya:\n\n**\Kabhi Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) aik hi joota (sandal) pehna kar chalte the.\""**\n\n**Tafseel:**\nYeh hadith batati hain ke Aqdas-e-Akram (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) ne kabhi kabhi sirf ek joota pehna kar chalte the. Yeh unki sadaqat aur tawadha ko zahir karti hai"","" jahan woh zaroorat se zyada cheezon par tawajjuh nahi dete the. Is hadith se yeh bhi maloom hota hai ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) ne apni zindagi mein bhi aise asaani aur saadgi ka tareeqa ikhtiyar kiya"","" jahan woh do jooton ki bajaye ek hi joota pehna kar chal sakte the."""""
"1837","Abu Dharr (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \tm myn say kwyy shkhs kwyy nyky hqyr ndashmar nh kray، chahay as kay pas kchh bhy nh hw۔\"""""""
"1838","Abu Musa (Razi Allah Anhu) rivayet karte hain ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Bahut se mard mukammal ho gaye hain...\"""""""
"1839","**Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\nHazrat Abdullah bin Al-Harith (رضی اللہ عنہ) سے روایت ہے کہ انہوں نے فرمایا: \میرے والد نے میری شادی کرائی اور انہوں نے لوگوں کو دعوت دی۔\"""""""
"1840","Ja'far bin Amr bin Umayyah Ad-Damri (rz all anh) nay apnay wald say rwayt ky hay kh anhwn nay nby akrm ﷺ kw dykha kh aap bkry ky kndhay kay gwsht kay tkray pr chhyd kr rhay thay awr as myn say kha rhay thay۔"
"1841","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) rivayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke paas kuch goshaedaar laaye gaye aur unke saamne (dast-e-dahan) ka hissa pesh kiya gaya."
"1842","Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat ki: \Raasool Allah (ﷺ) ko gosht ka sab se zyada rehaya hissa rana (foreleg) nahi tha.\"""""""
"1843","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Sirka kitna acha masala hai!\"""""""
"1844","Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Sirka behtareen masala hai.\"" Ekosri silsile mein isi tarah hai"","" magar is mein (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Behtareen masala\"""""""
"1845","**Umm Hani' bint Abi Talib (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat farmaya ke: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) mere paas aaye aur farmaya: 'Kya tumhare paas kuch hai?' Maine kaha: 'Nahi.'\""**"""""
"1846","Jabir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby akrm ﷺ nay frmaya: \srkh ktna achha mzaq hay۔\"" as mwzwa pr aayshh (rz all anha) awr am hany (rz all anha) say bhy rwayat hyn۔"""""
"1847","Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) tarbooz ko taaze khajoor ke saath farma liya karte the.\"" Unhon ne farmaya: Is mein Anas (Razi Allah Anha) se bhi kuch hai. [Abu Eisa (Rahmatullah Alaih) ne farmaya:] Ye hadith Hasan Gharib hai. Baaz ne ise Hisham bin Urwah se"","" unke baap se"","" Mursal tareeqe se Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se riwayat ki hai."""""
"1848","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujh sey farmaya : ''agar tum (aakhirat mein) mujh sey milna chahti ho to duniya sey musafir key saman safar key barabar hasil karney par iktifa karo, maaldaaron ki sohbat sey bacho aur kisi kapdey ko us waqt tak puraana na samajh yahan tak ke is mein pewand laga lo''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- hum isey sirf Saleh bin Hassan ki riwayat sey jantey hain, 3- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko kehtey suna : Saleh bin Hassan munkire-hadees hain aur Saleh bin abi Hassan jin sey ibne-Abi Zi-ib ney riwayat ki hai wo Suqa hain"
"1849","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam Makka is haal mein aaye ke aap ki chaar chotiyan thin. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain : Umme-Haani sey Mujahid ka samaa, main nahin janta hun."
"1850","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key Sahaba ki aasteenein kushada thin . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees munkar hai, 2- Abdullah bin Basar Basra key rehney waley hain, muhaddeseen key nazdik zaeef hain, Yahya bin Saeed waghera ney unhen zaeef kaha hai, 3- «"
"1851","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney apni ya meri pindli ka gosht pakda aur farmaya : '' ye tehband ki jagah hai, agar is par razi na ho to thoda aur neecha kar lo , phir agar aur neecha karna chaho to tehband takhnon sey neecha nahin kar saktey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, Sory aur Shoba ney bhi us ko Abu-Is'haq Sabeei sey riwayat kya hai."
"1852","Rukana ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey kushti ladi to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney usey pachhaad diya, Rukana kehtey hain : mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko kehtey huye suna : '' hamarey aur mushrikon key darmiyan farq topiyon par amaama baandhney ka hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- iski sanad qaaim ( sahih ( nahin hai, 3- hum abul-Hasan Asqalani aur ibn Rukana ko nahin jantey hain."
"1853","eik aadmi Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas lohey ki angoothi pehan kar aaya, aap ney farmaya : '' kya baat hai main dekh raha hun ke tum jahannamiyon ka zewar pehney ho? '' phir wo aap key paas peetal ki anguthi pehan kar aaya, aap ney farmaya : ''kya baat hai ke tum sey buton ki badbu aa rahi hai? phir wo aap key paas soney ki anguthi pehan kar aaya, to aap ney farmaya : '' kya baat hai main dekh raha hun ke tum jannatiyon ka zewar pehney ho? usney puchha : main kis chiz ki anguthi pehnun? aap ney farmaya : '' chaandi ki aur (wazan mein) eik Misqal sey kam rakho''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr sey bhi riwayat hai, 3- Abdullah bin Muslim ki kunniyat abu-Taiba hai aur wo Abdullah bin Muslim Maruzi hain."
"1854","mujhey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney «qassi» (eik reshmi kapda ( surkh ( rang ka reshmi ( zeen posh aur us ungli aur us ungli mein angoothi pehanney sey mana farmaya aur unhoney shahadat aur beech ki ungli ki taraf ishara kya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1855","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka pasandida kapda jisey aap pehantey they wo dhaari daar yamni chadar thi . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"1856","Hadees ke mutabiq, Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ki: \Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko dekha ki Woh (ﷺ) thali ke kinaron se"","" yani kaddu (squash/pumpkin) se khana le rahe the. Us waqt se mujhe yeh cheez pasand hai.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] Yeh Hadees Hasan Sahih hai. Yeh Hadees Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) se zariyon se aayi hai."""""
"1857","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Zayd ibn Akhzam al-Ṥā'ī ne hamen bayān farmāyā, Salm ibn Qutaybah ne riwāyat kī, Shu'bah ne Ayyūb se riwāyat kī, Ayyūb ne Abū Qilābah se, aur Abū Qilābah ne Abū Tha'labah (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ) se riwāyat kī, ki:**\n\nRasūlullāh ﷺ se Majūs (Magians/Zoroastrians) ke bartan ke bāre mein pūchhā gaya. Āpa ﷺ ne farmāyā: **\Unhen dho kar pāsh pāsh karo"","" aur un mein pakāo.\""** Aur Āpa ﷺ ne har nesh wāle dānte jānvar se nahīṅ kar diyā.\n\nAbū 'Īsā [al-Tirmidhī] ne farmāyā: *\""Yeh Abū Tha'labah (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهū) kī hadīth mashhūr hai"","" aur ise un se dusre asānīd se bhī riwāyat kī ga'ī hai. Abū Tha'labah kā nām Jurthum hai"","" aur kahā bhī jātā hai Jurhum"","" aur kahā bhī jātā hai Nāshib. Aur yeh hadīth Abū Qilābah se Abū Asmā' al-Raḥabī ke wāsiṭe se Abū Tha'labah (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ"""""
"1858","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Abu Tha'labah Khushani (Razi Allah Unho se) ne riwayat farmaya:**\n\nUnhon ne kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah ﷺ"","" hum Ahle-e-Kitaab ki zindagi mukhtalif zameen mein hain"","" is liye unke bartanon mein pakate hain aur unke bartanon se peete hain.\""\n\nRasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: **\""Agar tumhein koi doosra bartan na mile"","" to unhein paak karne ke liye paani se dho do.\""**\n\nPhir unhon ne kaha: \""Ya Rasool Allah ﷺ"","" hum shikar ki zameen mein hain"","" to hum kya karein?\""\n\nAap ﷺ ne farmaya: **\""Agar tum apna mualim kutta bhejo aur Allah ka naam le kar bhejo aur woh shikar kare"","" to khao. Agar woh mualim kutta na ho"","" to agar woh sahi tarike se zabah ho jaye"","" to khao. Aur agar tum apni teer se shikar karein aur Allah ka naam lein aur woh shikar ho jaye"","" to khao.\""**\n\n---\n\n**Abu Isa (Tirmizi) ne kaha:** Yeh hadith *hasan sahih* hai.\n\n---\n\n### Tarjume ke Notes:\n\n- **الْمُكَلَّب (al-mukallab):** Woh mualim shikar kutta jise aagahi di gayi ho ke woh hukm maane aur apne shikar ko na khaaye.\n- **ذُكِّيَ (dhukkiya):** Sahih Islami zabah (*dhabh*) ka matlab hai"","" yani janwar Islami tareeqe se zabah kiya gaya ho.\n- **ارْحَضُوهَا"""""
"1859","Hazrat Imam Tirmidhi (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ne yeh riwayat Hazrat Zaid bin Aslam (Razi Allah Anho) se naql farmayi hai, aur kisi waqt unhone isme shubha bhi zahir farmaya, aur kaha: \n**\Mujhe lagta hai ke yeh Hazrat Umar (Razi Allah Anho) ki taraf se Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se marfoo' hai.\""** \nAur kisi waqt unhone yeh bhi kaha: \n**\""Yeh hadees Zaid bin Aslam"","" unke baap (Aslam) ke zariye se Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se mursal tareeqe se marfoo' hai.\""** \n\n*Jam' al-Tirmidhi"","" Hadees No. 1851*"""""
"1860","Abu Asid (raz) rivayat hain: \Nabi (ﷺ) ne farmaya: Iske tel khao aur is (zaitun) ko istemal karo.\"""""""
